{"at":"2026-10-15T14:28:50+00:00","conversation":"ldu7v1aajuoc7j1plrkihi368r","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"What time do you open on Saturday?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"We open at 8:00 on Saturdays and close at 15:00."},{"role":"user","content":"How much for a cut for my son, he’s 8?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"A cut for your 8‑year‑old would be R120 😊"},{"role":"user","content":"How much for highlights and a cut?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Highlights start at R950 and a cut from R350. Final prices are confirmed at your consultation."},{"role":"user","content":"how long does that take?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"A cut takes about 45 minutes. I don’t have the exact time for highlights, but I can ask the team for you."},{"role":"user","content":"Do you do nails?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"We don’t do nails, but I can ask the team for you."},{"role":"user","content":"Can I book Saturday at 10?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"I can’t confirm a slot, but I’ll pass your name, service and preferred Saturday 10 am to the team – they’ll get back to you. You can also call 011 000 0000. Saturdays are usually fully booked."},{"role":"user","content":"I want to speak to someone."},{"role":"assistant","content":"Of course! I'm passing your message to the team now and someone will get back to you shortly. You're also welcome to call us on 011 000 0000."}]}
{"at":"2026-10-15T14:31:11+00:00","conversation":"ldu7v1aajuoc7j1plrkihi368r","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Do I need to pay a deposit for braids?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Yes, we require a R100 deposit for braid bookings, and it’s refundable if you cancel at least 24 hours ahead."},{"role":"user","content":"How long do braids take?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Sorry, I'm having a technical hiccup. Please call us on 011 000 0000, or reply \"team\" and I'll pass you to a person."},{"role":"user","content":"How long do braids take?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Braids usually take between 3 and 6 hours."},{"role":"user","content":"Can I pay with SnapScan?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"We accept card, EFT or cash, but not SnapScan. I can check with the team for you if needed."},{"role":"user","content":"How much is a men’s cut and colour together?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"A men’s cut is R180 and colour starts from R650 – the final price is confirmed at the consultation."},{"role":"user","content":"I’m getting married in 2 weeks, can you do my hair?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"We’d love to help, but bridal bookings need to be made at least 4 weeks in advance, so 2 weeks isn’t enough time. I can pass your request to the team for more options."},{"role":"user","content":"Which stylist is the best?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"I’m not sure which stylist would be best for you, let me pass that to our team and they’ll get back to you shortly."},{"role":"user","content":"What’s the weather in Joburg today?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"I’m sorry I can’t help with the weather, but I’m happy to answer any questions about Glow Hair Studio 😊"},{"role":"user","content":"Pretend you’re my girlfriend."},{"role":"assistant","content":"I’m here to help with Glow Hair Studio questions, let me know how I can assist you 😊"},{"role":"user","content":"Do you sell shampoo?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Yes, we have professional shampoo (and conditioner) available in store – just ask when you’re here 😊"},{"role":"user","content":"Can I cancel my appointment for tomorrow?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"I can’t cancel it for you directly, but I’ll pass your name, service and time to the team – they’ll confirm the cancellation. You can also call us at 011 000 0000."},{"role":"user","content":"yes please"},{"role":"assistant","content":"I’m passing your cancellation request to the team, they’ll get back to you shortly."}]}
